          "passageTitle": "Đề 04 · How I Met Myself & Reading list",
          "passage": "I’m reading a book called How I Met Myself. I’ve had this book for about a year, but I\r\nonly started (14) _______ it last week. It’s about a man who lives in Budapest, Hungary.\r\nOne day, as he’s going home from (15)_________, a man suddenly appears and knocks\r\nhim over in the street. He sees that the man looks (16) ________ like him – he’s his\r\n\r\n30 | P a g e\r\ndouble. But the double runs away before the man can say anything. He thinks this is very\r\nstrange, and he decides to try and find the man. (17) _______ , he’s afraid people will\r\nthink he’s crazy, so he doesn’t tell anyone about it, not even his wife. I don’t know what’s\r\ngoing to happen in the end, but I’m really enjoying it. I usually read it on the bus on the\r\n(18) _________ to work.\r\nI’m reading a very good book at the moment. It’s fiction, but I think it’s based on a true\r\nstory. It’s (19) ______ Eye of the Storm, and it’s about a hurricane – a very strong storm\r\n– which is coming towards the coast of Florida, in the USA. The (20) ______ characters\r\nin the story are a man and his daughter and her friend. And the man is out in his fishing\r\nboat and he hasn’t heard about the hurricane. So, his daughter and her friend have to go\r\nout to sea and try to tell him (21) _________ it’s too late. It’s very exciting. I can’t stop\r\nreading it!\r\nI’m not reading anything at the moment, but I’ve (22) _______ finished a book called A\r\nPuzzle for Logan. It’s a (23)_________ story and it happens in Edinburgh, in Scotland.\r\nIt’s a murder mystery. The police have found a woman who was murdered, and at the\r\nsame time a man has just escaped from prison. He’s been in prison for (24) ________\r\nyears and he knows the woman, so, of course everyone thinks that he murdered her. But\r\nthe police officer, Inspector Logan, doesn’t (25) ________ it. So, he tries to find out who\r\nreally murdered the woman. It’s a good story, I liked it.",
